==Strategy==
This feast of Doges might look worrisome, but it isn't too hard. You can deal with the Zoges like an average Outbreak level in Empire of Cats. Bring at least 2-4 meatshields to bring down the Metal Doges, or any critical hitters. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] is strongly recommended. Aku Doges have very weak shields, so any melee unit can destroy them. Wave Attack Cats like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can be helpful, although Long Distance Cats like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] can do the same. Overall, meatshield spam is your key to win.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], this stage was named Doge-Packed Garden, however, with the addition of a fourth stage to Snow Doges, this stage received a new name, and its old name was instead given to the next stage.

